17
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,640
Aussie!

18
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,000
But to claim the title...

19
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,920
TONY: This season
is gonna be short and fast,

20
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,000
