seven of the world's best.

23
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,760
PARVATI: I've been playing this game
for decades.

24
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,280
For decades.

25
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,560
The three greats from the US...

26
