35
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,120
Rob.

36
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,520
..blowing up his own game.

37
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:39,640
13 are left.
Who will be going home tonight?

38
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,280
Oh, yeah?
Yeah.

39
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,480
There has to be something.

40
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:17,080
You thought you could keep
the King of the Jungle

41
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,000
