43
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,360
Dreamin'!

44
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,800
Is it in here?
I would put it in here.

45
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,520
It's a fast-paced game.

46
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:33,960
But I always keep a few tricks
under my sleeve.

47
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,720
(LAUGHS)

48
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,720
Oh, nice.
So, yeah, OK.

49
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,320
Yeah, exactly. So...

50
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:52,920
Um...we don't know.
No.

51
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,080
