63
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,480
Oh, my God.

64
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Oh, my God. How crazy is that?

65
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,240
Oh!

66
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,120
