77
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,600
Huh!

78
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,320
He wanted
a unanimous vote yesterday.

79
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:04,320
Poor sweet blindsided baby Rob.

80
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,960
