TOMMI: Going?

92
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,000
Yeah.

93
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,360
Oh, God.
Come to the water?

94
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,440
Yeah.

95
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:55,120
Maybe I gotta put a nice log
in there.

96
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,400
I'm best known on Survivor

97
00:06:57,400 --> 00:07:00,280
