I put myself in house arrest.

99
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:08,200
Quiet. You know?
Staying in camp, not running around.

100
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:11,680
It worked.
I won ¤2 million because of it.

101
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,040
And that's what I'm doing here too.
That's my strategy right now.

102
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,880
But once I get some traction,
I'm gonna be a runaway train.

103
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,720
(PARVATI, CIRIE AND KASS LAUGH)

104
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,000
