KASS: Yes.

116
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,080
We can, like, get Lisa, 100%.

117
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,560
We can really make this happen.
Yeah. Totally.

118
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,000
