is like a weed.

147
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,760
I'd like to have
real hair like this one day.

148
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,840
You sort of do.

149
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,560
(LAUGHS)

150
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:45,920
I'm working really hard on Kirby.

151
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,400
(LAUGHS)

152
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,520
This is the girlest thing
I've ever done.

153
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,560
Yeah, I want to make her
feel like she can trust me.

154
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,120
(LAUGHS)

155
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,080
Because if we get five,

156
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,600
and with George and Shonee
on the outs,

157
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,640
I can have my way with this tribe

158
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,480
