a roaring start.

159
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,280
Thoughts on today?

160
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,280
We're solid, right?

161
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:06,280
Whatever you think. Yeah.

162
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:08,080
We're solid?
Yep.

163
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:12,040
Right now, Shon's pretty quiet...

164
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:16,120
