166
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,480
What are you thinking?

167
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,160
I mean, exactly what you said.

168
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:27,840
I'm in amongst the kings and queens
and gods of the game.

169
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:31,000
And I'm just a princess
in this tribe,

170
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,920
so I'm playing my role,

171
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:36,960
