that I don't know a lot.

172
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:42,760
But I... (LAUGHS)

173
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,800
I love that.

174
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,520
It's powerful.

175
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,840
