His network of spies
will turn on you.

185
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,680
I...

186
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,800
Strongest...

187
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,160
David...

188
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:05,520
Look, the easy option is Janine,
and we survive.

189
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,320
Then we can start getting exciting.

190
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:13,560
David, he's the Golden God
for a reason.

191
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:21,080
David has the charisma to pull
any player wherever he wants.

192
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,120
I like this a lot, Shon. Keep going.
(LAUGHS)

193
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,520
Tell me more, tell me more.

194
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:28,040
I'm very wary of people like that,

195
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,280
