it'd be like... I'd be, like...

200
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,280
Exposed?
Yes.

201
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,160
Are you open to...to, like...

202
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,600
Yeah.

203
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,560
Like, genuinely. Like...
I'd have to think...

204
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,560
I'd have to think about it.

205
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:57,480
Because he's a meat shield.

206
