queens. What are you talking about?

207
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:08,320
It's wild because I don't think
they know how to say no to him.

208
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,400
That's the problem.

209
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:15,080
George is still on the cards,
but he's not going to win immunity.

210
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:28,520
