from the modelling days.

216
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,800
We are close. We are friends.

217
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:54,160
What do you... What are you...
How do you like to play?

218
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,640
Like, we've never played together.
Yeah.

219
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,320
