ultimately bit me in the bum.

229
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,280
I was unanimously voted off.

230
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,840
Yeah.

231
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,840
See, I'd rather...

232
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:15,920
Yeah.

233
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:25,520
This is the biggest game of Survivor
in the world.

234
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:27,560
Everyone has come to play.

235
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:30,320
There's kings, there's queens
and there's gods.

236
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:36,680
And I'm here to be the god slayer.

237
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,840
Come on in.

238
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:20,480
GEORGE: Ooh-ee!

239
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,240
LUKE: Oh, wow.

240
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:28,120
