243
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:47,920
Rob voted out
last night's tribal council.

244
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,760
(GASPS) Rob Bentele's gone!

245
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,000
No way.
Wow.

246
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,720
JANINE: Wow.

247
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,320
Good work.

248
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,920
Wow. Wowee, wow.

249
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:02,960
So, Parvati.
Interesting tribal last night.

250
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:04,000
It sure was.

251
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,120
What was the vibe like
when you got back to camp?

252
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:09,160
We were more unified
when we came back to camp,

253
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:11,520
