really helpful for us.

254
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:14,600
So was it a 6-1 vote?
(LUKE CHUCKLES) Yeah.

255
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,400
Let's get down to the nitty gritty.

256
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:20,080
